s with reading.\n\nExtra educational games include jigsaw puzzles and memory games. These puzzle games are especially designed for preschoolers and have 3 levels to progress through.\n\nEnjoy endless surprises and giggles - just choose new photos for every game. Children love to see themselves (or Daddy, Grandma, even your family pet!) as the star of the games.\n\nFun features - and sshhh, educational too :)\n• Imaginative role-play for girls and boys, starring your child in all the action\n• Sing along to a favorite nursery rhyme\n• Learn animal names and sounds\n• Develop fine motor skills with jigsaw puzzles\n• Improve memory skills and concentration with memory match games\n• Learn about rhythm and music\n• Get creative - make characters using your photos, just add hats & hair!\n\n• Explore at your own pace, no rules or time pressures\n• Great for toddlers and preschoolers ages 2-5    \n• No in-app purchases\n• No third-party advertising, so you’re free to discover without interruptions\n\nOkiPlay is a family games studio, devoted to learning and play. Children's book artist, John Abbott, is our illustrator. We're members of Moms with Apps, a collaborative group of family-friendly developers promoting quality apps for kids and families. Our preschool educational apps are loved & trusted by parents, teachers and children all over the world. That makes us very happy.\n\nParent & teacher reviews for OkiPlay games:\n\n• “I am a Speech Language Pathologist working with 3-5 year olds. This interactive game really keeps their attention. They are very engaged and love being a part of the game. I love all the speech and language opportunities.”\n\n• “Absolutely gorgeous - both our children were totally captivated by this app ...the personalization feature is fantastic, and the graphics are charming.”\n\n• “As a speech therapy assistant, this is me and my kiddos' favorite app! It's so awesome to personalize the game with their own face, and add different hats and hair.”\n